[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/892663975","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1306#issuecomment-892663975","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1306","id":892663975,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE841NPin","user":{"login":"xenon-dev","id":84480131,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0NDgwMTMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84480131?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xenon-dev","html_url":"https://github.com/xenon-dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xenon-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xenon-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xenon-dev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xenon-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xenon-dev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xenon-dev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xenon-dev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xenon-dev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xenon-dev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-04T13:35:28Z","updated_at":"2021-09-03T09:08:25Z","body":"Please note: This License request was submitted by me through the online tool: \"https://tools.spdx.org/app/submit_new_license/\", which validates the license using the ascii codec (instead of something like UTF-8). I had to manipulate the license name a bit, in order to get it through the filtering:\r\nThe correct name, like given on the page is: \"DL-DE->BY-2.0\" and would also be put in like that in license headers later on, but it would not match the given short-identifier here, which could lead to problems... Can this be somehow corrected afterwards or would you think it would still work?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/892663975/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/892686000","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1306#issuecomment-892686000","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1306","id":892686000,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE841NU6w","user":{"login":"seabass-labrax","id":79224200,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MjI0MjAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79224200?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax","html_url":"https://github.com/seabass-labrax","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-04T14:03:21Z","updated_at":"2021-08-04T14:03:21Z","body":"@xenon-dev, welcome to SPDX!\n\nThere are really three types of name when it comes to entries to the License List. There is the short identifier, the name which is shown on <https://spdx.org/licenses> and the `titleText`, which is only shown in the license text itself. It is perfectly fine if those names differ from each other, so no need for concern there!\n\nThank you for your new license request; I hope to review it soon. :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/892686000/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/894839563","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1306#issuecomment-894839563","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1306","id":894839563,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE841VisL","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-08T18:53:02Z","updated_at":"2021-08-08T18:53:02Z","body":"Hi @xenon-dev, \r\n\r\nJust a comment on the license short identifier (e.g., what would appear on https://spdx.org/licenses as @seabass-labrax noted, and also in `SPDX-License-Identifier: _______` tags as described at https://spdx.dev/ids:\r\n\r\nThe valid characters for these identifiers are letters, numbers, hyphen (`-`) and period (`.`). See [Appendix IV of the SPDX spec](https://spdx.github.io/spdx-spec/appendix-IV-SPDX-license-expressions/) for more details. That means that the `>` character wouldn't be able to be included in the identifier.\r\n\r\nBut DL-DE-BY-2.0 should be fine as an identifier (if the license is accepted to add to the License List, of course) and the full name + titleText may be able to accommodate a broader set of characters.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/894839563/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/901457717","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1306#issuecomment-901457717","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1306","id":901457717,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE841uyc1","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-18T22:00:25Z","u